# House rules for this folder

## What this folder is
A weekly shipments export from our transport planning. The data is made up.

## Rules
- A week is an ISO week, Monday to Friday. "This week" is the last full week in the file.
- BE-NL and NL-BE are two separate routes.
- Every number comes from the file. Name the weeks you compared.
- For the Monday overview, follow monday-overview.md.

## Never
- Never change or delete shipments-export-sample.csv.
- Never create a file unless I ask for one.
- Never send anything.
